  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Blueberry_Muffin.png|200px|left|Blueberry muffin]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 33\n |price = 1 to 230\n |time = 45 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|Bakery|bigger|link=Bakery}}\n |xp = 28\n |base = 64\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 38 min\n}}\n'''Blueberry muffin''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 33. It was added in September 2025 update.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making blueberry muffins'''===\n[[File:Bakery.png|150px|left|Bakery]]\nBlueberry muffins are made in the [[Bakery]].\n\nTo make a muffin, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|link=Wheat|Wheat]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|link=Egg|Eggs]]\n|[[File:Blueberries.png|75px|link=Blueberries|Blueberries]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x2'''\n|}\nIt takes 45 minutes to make one muffin, and 38 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] Bakery. Each muffin gives players 28 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling blueberry muffins'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Blueberry muffins can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,304 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 muffins.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a muffin costs 203 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 3 blueberry muffins per crate, up to a total of 9 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Blaubeer-Muffin\n|es = Magdalena de arándanos\n|no = Blåbærmuffins\n|ru = Кекс с черникой\n}}\n[[pt-br:Bolinho de mirtilo]]\n\n[[Category:Bakery Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Blueberries Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]",
